"s":296.44,"e":297.19,"line":76},{"w":"one","s":297.19,"e":297.44,"line":76},{"w":"beautiful","s":297.44,"e":298.19,"line":76},{"w":"day,","s":298.19,"e":298.53,"line":76},{"w":"One","s":298.53,"e":298.8,"line":77},{"w":"more","s":298.8,"e":299.15,"line":77},{"w":"chance","s":299.15,"e":299.69,"line":77},{"w":"to","s":299.69,"e":299.86,"line":77},{"w":"love","s":299.86,"e":300.22,"line":77},{"w":"along","s":300.22,"e":300.67,"line":77},{"w":"the","s":300.67,"e":300.93,"line":77},{"w":"way.","s":300.93,"e":301.29,"line":77},{"w":"A","s":301.29,"e":301.45,"line":78},{"w":"hundred","s":301.45,"e":302.03,"line":78},{"w":"books","s":302.03,"e":302.45,"line":78},{"w":"could","s":302.45,"e":302.86,"line":78},{"w":"never","s":302.86,"e":303.27,"line":78},{"w":"write","s":303.27,"e":303.69,"line":78},{"w":"The","s":303.69,"e":303.94,"line":79},{"w":"life","s":303.94,"e":304.28,"line":79},{"w":"you're","s":304.28,"e":304.78,"line":79},{"w":"making","s":304.78,"e":305.29,"line":79},{"w":"here","s":305.29,"e":305.63,"line":79},{"w":"tonight.","s":305.63,"e":306.3,"line":79},{"w":"Make","s":306.3,"e":306.64,"line":80},{"w":"one","s":306.64,"e":306.89,"line":80},{"w":"corner","s":306.89,"e":307.39,"line":80},{"w":"bright.","s":307.39,"e":307.97,"line":80},{"w":"Make","s":307.97,"e":308.31,"line":81},{"w":"one","s":308.31,"e":308.56,"line":81},{"w":"corner","s":308.56,"e":309.06,"line":81},{"w":"bright.","s":309.06,"e":309.64,"line":81},{"w":"And","s":309.64,"e":309.9,"line":82},{"w":"we'll","s":309.9,"e":310.33,"line":82},{"w":"shine","s":310.33,"e":310.75,"line":82},{"w":"a","s":310.75,"e":310.93,"line":82},{"w":"little","s":310.93,"e":311.44,"line":82},{"w":"brighter","s":311.44,"e":312.12,"line":82},{"w":"side","s":312.12,"e":312.46,"line":82},{"w":"by","s":312.46,"e":312.63,"line":82},{"w":"side.","s":312.63,"e":313.06,"line":82}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":3.6,"text":"A hundred books, a hundred roads,"},{"s":3.6,"e":6,"text":"A thousand ways a heart can grow."},{"s":6,"e":8.97,"text":"The endings differ, but one truth shines:"},{"s":8.97,"e":11.59,"text":"It's what we give that makes a life."},{"s":11.59,"e":15.88,"text":"An old knight fought a windmill in a storm of make-believe,"},{"s":15.88,"e":19.8,"text":"So I let imagination breathe, but question what I see."},{"s":19.8,"e":24.16,"text":"A young woman judged a stranger till her certainty gave way,"},{"s":24.16,"e":28.08,"text":"Now I leave a little room for what I don't know today."},{"s":28.08,"e":32.3,"text":"A hobbit left a warm house with his trembling little feet,"},{"s":32.3,"e":37.31,"text":"Turns out courage comes from moving, not from knowing you'll succeed."},{"s":37.31,"e":40.95,"text":"A boy upon a river chose a friend above the crowd,"},{"s":40.95,"e":45.67,"text":"Now I'll stand for what is decent, even when my voice ain't loud."},{"s":45.67,"e":50.17,"text":"A girl protected her own heart when the easy choice was wrong,"},{"s":50.17,"e":55.11,"text":"So my boundaries aren't a weakness, they're a way of staying strong."},{"s":55.11,"e":59.33,"text":"Every life is full of chapters no one else gets to choose,"},{"s":59.33,"e":63.76,"text":"And the first page of my future is the next right thing I do."},{"s":63.76,"e":67.25,"text":"Maybe wisdom isn't thunder falling from the sky,"},{"s":67.25,"e":70.88,"text":"Maybe it's the way we see the stranger passing by."},{"s":70.88,"e":75.1,"text":"Maybe joy's not at the finish of a race we're born to run,"},{"s":75.1,"e":78.95,"text":"Maybe it's the love we share beneath the morning sun."},{"s":78.95,"e":81.85,"text":"Turn the page, let the daylight through,"},{"s":81.85,"e":84.91,"text":"The story isn't over, and neither are you."},{"s":84.91,"e":88.39,"text":"Give a little grace, let the small things shine,"},{"s":88.39,"e":91.08,"text":"A hundred books, one heart, one life."},{"s":91.08,"e":95.51,"text":"Tell the truth, take a chance, let your kindness take flight,"},{"s":95.51,"e":99.07,"text":"If the world's too heavy, make one corner bright."},{"s":99.07,"e":102.63,"text":"You don't need the ending to know where to start,"},{"s":102.63,"e":105.9,"text":"Write another beautiful line with your heart."},{"s":105.9,"e":110.41,"text":"A sailor chased a white whale till the sea swallowed his name,"},{"s":110.41,"e":114.77,"text":"I won't turn my every heartbreak into someone else to blame."},{"s":114.77,"e":118.91,"text":"A mansion full of music couldn't purchase something real,"},{"s":118.91,"e":123.56,"text":"So I'll treasure kitchen laughter and the hands that I can feel."},{"s":123.56,"e":127.56,"text":"A maker loved the glory, left his creation in the cold,"},{"s":127.56,"e":132.13,"text":"I'll take care of what I'm building and the people that I hold."},{"s":132.13,"e":135.84,"text":"A miser saw tomorrow, turned his riches into gifts,"},{"s":135.84,"e":139.76,"text":"A man received forgiveness and discovered how to live."},{"s":139.76,"e":143.83,"text":"A little prince loved one rose beneath a thousand stars,"},{"s":143.83,"e":148.34,"text":"So I'll call the ones I cherish, tell them how loved they are."},{"s":148.34,"e":152.77,"text":"I'll say sorry without speeches, lend a hand without a stage,"},{"s":152.77,"e":157.28,"text":"Love is something that you practice, not a sentence on a page."},{"s":157.28,"e":160.18,"text":"Turn the page, let the daylight through,"},{"s":160.18,"e":163.23,"text":"The story isn't over, and neither are you."},{"s":163.23,"e":166.72,"text":"Give a little grace, let the small things shine,"},{"s":166.72,"e":169.41,"text":"A hundred books, one heart, one life."},{"s":169.41,"e":173.84,"text":"Tell the truth, take a chance, let your kindness take flight,"},{"s":173.84,"e":177.4,"text":"If the world's too heavy, make one corner bright."},{"s":177.4,"e":180.96,"text":"You don't need the ending to know where to start,"},{"s":180.96,"e":184.23,"text":"Write another beautiful line with your heart."},{"s":184.23,"e":188.59,"text":"Some books show how the powerful can teach the world to lie,"},{"s":188.59,"e":192.81,"text":"How a promise made for everyone can leave the weak behind."},{"s":192.81,"e":197.09,"text":"So I question, seek the evidence, and stand with open eyes,"},{"s":197.09,"e":201.31,"text":"Never trade my right to wonder for a comfortable disguise."},{"s":201.31,"e":205.23,"text":"A family crossed a country with so little left to own,"},{"s":205.23,"e":209.74,"text":"Found a lifeline in the kindness of the strangers on the road."},{"s":209.74,"e":213.95,"text":"A secret garden flourished when small hands began to care,"},{"s":213.95,"e":217.37,"text":"And a dreamer found a universe in ordinary air."},{"s":217.37,"e":221.51,"text":"I can change a tiny corner; there's a million more to go,"},{"s":221.51,"e":226.23,"text":"But a million little kindnesses are how brighter worlds can grow."},{"s":226.23,"e":229.86,"text":"So I make a little room for somebody else's story,"},{"s":229.86,"e":234.37,"text":"Shared success is so much sweeter than a lonely kind of glory."},{"s":234.37,"e":239.02,"text":"Some chapters end too early, some are written through the tears,"},{"s":239.02,"e":242.94,"text":"And love keeps quiet company across the passing years."},{"s":242.94,"e":247.59,"text":"You can miss a voice at dinner and still laugh at something new,"},{"s":247.59,"e":251.52,"text":"A sky can carry both the rain and every shade of blue."},{"s":251.52,"e":255.95,"text":"Tonight I'll name three little gifts, tomorrow call a friend,"},{"s":255.95,"e":259.94,"text":"Lay down what I can't control, pick up what I can mend."},{"s":259.94,"e":264.16,"text":"I can't erase all sorrow, but I can help somebody through,"},{"s":264.16,"e":268.81,"text":"And sometimes making someone smile brings my own smile back too."},{"s":268.81,"e":271.72,"text":"TURN THE PAGE! LET THE DAYLIGHT THROUGH!"},{"s":271.72,"e":274.77,"text":"THE STORY ISN'T OVER, AND NEITHER ARE YOU!"},{"s":274.77,"e":278.26,"text":"Give a little grace, let the small things shine,"},{"s":278.26,"e":280.94,"text":"A HUNDRED BOOKS, ONE HEART, ONE LIFE!"},{"s":280.94,"e":285.38,"text":"Tell the truth, take a chance, let your kindness take flight,"},{"s":285.38,"e":288.94,"text":"If the world's too heavy, MAKE ONE CORNER BRIGHT!"},{"s":288.94,"e":292.5,"text":"You don't need the ending to know where to start,"},{"s":292.5,"e":295.77,"text":"Write another beautiful line with your heart!"},{"s":295.77,"e":298.53,"text":"One small kindness, one beautiful day,"},{"s":298.53,"e":301.29,"text":"One more chance to love along the way."},{"s":301.29,"e":303.69,"text":"A hundred books could never write"},{"s":303.69,"e":306.3,"text":"The life you're making here tonight."},{"s":306.3,"e":307.97,"text":"Make one corner bright."},{"s":307.97,"e":309.64,"text":"Make one corner bright."},{"s":309.64,"e":313.06,"text":"And we'll shine a little brighter side by side."}],"duration":313.56,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}